Package: jonsolberg-wallpapers
Version: 1.5
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1
Recommends: libnotify-bin, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Maintainer: Jon Solberg <jonsolberg.x@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://jonsolberg.se:8080/
Description: Wallpapers from jonsolberg.se in the top bar
 Changes the desktop picture every hour, day or week, or when a new
 wallpaper is published on jonsolberg.se, and picks the picture size
 that fits the screen (Full HD, 16:10, ultrawide or 4K).
 Works on GNOME (Ubuntu), KDE Plasma, Xfce, Cinnamon and MATE.
